** BROKEN (convergence): finite-strain elastic-plastic stretch applied in a
** SINGLE forced increment (STEP INC=1, fixed full time increment) with NLGEOM.
** One full increment over large plastic strain will not converge and no
** cutback is permitted -> the step aborts.
** Expected auto-fix: convergence_refinement raises the increment cap and
** shrinks the initial/minimum increment so the load is applied gradually.
*HEADING
Large-strain plastic stretch - forced single increment
